{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Pārāsariya (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.116'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.116 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.116 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dvādasamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Twelve </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Pārāpariyattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Pārāsariya (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Chaphassāyatane hitvā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve given up the six spheres of sense-contact, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>guttadvāro susaṁvuto; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>my sense doors are guarded and well restrained; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Aghamūlaṁ vamitvāna, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve ejected the root of gloom </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>patto me āsavakkhayo”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and attained the ending of defilements. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Pārāpariyo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
